OL,3,APoundland collapses putting 11,000 jobs
OL,4,Aat risk
OL,5,
OL,6,FPoundland has collapsed into
OL,7,Fadministration, putting 11,000 jobs at
OL,8,Frisk, after its owners failed to find a
OL,9,Fbuyer to keep it in business.
OL,11,FThe discount retailer formally entered
OL,12,Fadministration on Wednesday afternoon,
OL,13,Fjust weeks before Christmas.
OL,15,FPoundland's US owners held talks with
OL,16,Fseveral bidders over a last-minute
OL,17,Frescue deal for the business, but no
OL,18,Ftransaction was reached.
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/39
