OL,3,AEnergy bills to rise by 26% from
OL,4,AJanuary after gas prices surge
OL,5,
OL,6,FEnergy bills will soar by 26% for
OL,7,Fmillions of households in January after
OL,8,Fa surge in gas prices sparked by the
OL,9,FIran war.
OL,11,FA typical bill will increase by about
OL,12,F#37 a month in the first three months
OL,13,Fof the new year, although the price
OL,14,Fwill depend on how much energy a
OL,15,Fhousehold uses, so it could be closer
OL,16,Fto #60 extra a month in winter.
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/39
