OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AMy family were killed in Ukraine. My
OL,4,Amum blamed Zelensky's troops - the
OL,5,Atruth is complicated
OL,6,
OL,7,FI am sitting on my balcony in Kyiv
OL,8,Flooking at a photo of a garden in the
OL,9,Fvillage I grew up in, in eastern
OL,10,FUkraine. The plot is overgrown with
OL,11,Fthick grass, and two wooden stakes are
OL,12,Fplanted in the ground. Despite the warm
OL,13,Fsunshine, I find myself shivering.
OL,15,FThe woman who sent me the photo says
OL,16,Fthe stakes mark the graves of my
OL,17,Fgrandparents, killed as the
OL,18,FUkrainian-Russian front line reached
OL,19,Four little community. Not far away, in
OL,20,Fanother garden in the village, the body
OL,21,Fof my father, Serezha, is buried in a
OL,22,Fgreenhouse.
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
